sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Order Service
    participant S as Saga Orchestrator
    participant B as Message Broker
    participant I as Inventory Service
    participant P as Payment Service
    participant G as Gateway Externo

    Note over S,I: Estoque já reservado (STOCK_RESERVED)
    S->>B: Cmd ProcessPayment
    B->>P: ProcessPayment
    P->>G: Autoriza pagamento
    G-->>P: Recusado
    P->>B: PaymentRefused (motivo)
    B->>S: PaymentRefused
    S->>S: Estado = COMPENSATING
    S->>B: Cmd ReleaseStock (compensação)
    B->>I: ReleaseStock
    I->>I: Libera reserva (idempotente)
    I->>B: StockReleased
    B->>S: StockReleased
    S->>B: Cmd CancelOrder (motivo)
    B->>O: CancelOrder
    O->>O: Pedido = CANCELED
    O->>B: OrderCanceled
    B->>S: OrderCanceled
    S->>S: Estado = COMPENSATED
